# Built dashboard SPA, bundled into the package at build time
# (`pnpm build` → `build:dashboard-ui`) and shipped via the `files` array.
# A build artifact, so kept out of source control like dist/.
dashboard-ui/

# Shipped DeepBook + sandbox-Pyth Move sources, assembled at build time
# (`pnpm build` → `build:deepbook-assets`) from
# `src/plugins/deepbook/bootstrap-assets/move` and shipped via the `files`
# array. A build artifact.
move-assets/

# Upstream DeepBook (deepbookv3) Move sources — ~9k lines of third-party Move
# fetched on demand at a pinned rev by `scripts/fetch-deepbook-move.mjs`
# (run by `build:deepbook-assets`), NOT vendored in git. The sibling
# `deepbook-sandbox/pyth` mock IS vendored (committed). See the fetch script.
src/plugins/deepbook/bootstrap-assets/move/deepbookv3/
